{"product":{"id":9728657457377,"title":"JEFFREY 118","body_html":"<p>The Jeffrey 118 is our high-speed powder twin: a 118mm freestyle ski built to float, charge, and stay playful when the resort gets deep.</p>\n<p>For 26/27, the Jeffrey 118 receives a new flex profile that is stiffer underfoot and through the forebody, with a touch more give in the tips. This adds support and stability without losing the playful feel that defines the Jeffrey Series. Signature Pow Rocker helps the ski plane early and stay loose in deep snow, while the longer Bi-Radius Sidecut keeps it composed at speed and predictable through chopped-up powder. A progressive mount and full twin tip let you get jibby in the deep without giving up the drive to charge through variable snow. This is the Jeffrey for skiers who want float first and still expect the ski to remain composed when the powder gets tracked out.</p>\n<p>Every Jeffrey 118 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, playful, and durable powder twin designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:18:22-07:00","handle":"jeffrey-118","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:45-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Jeffrey, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128493482209,"product_id":9728657457377,"title":"181cm","price":"949.00","sku":"27ON3PJF118181","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"181cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:18:22-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":2,"old_inventory_quantity":2,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"ma